cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or cite the Aksu Index, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent Blast Radius"
abstract: >-
  A static, zero-credit analyzer that resolves what the Apex and Flow behind a
  Salesforce Agentforce agent can reach at the execution-semantics layer, diffs
  that against the running user's effective permissions, and reports the result
  as the Aksu Index. The precedence law it implements was established by
  measurement in live orgs rather than from documentation.
authors:
  - family-names: Aksu
    given-names: Mustafa
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/aksumustafa1625/agent-blast-radius"
url: "https://agentblastradius.com"
keywords:
  - salesforce
  - agentforce
  - apex
  - static-analysis
  - field-level-security
